WHO   — Gwen DeMarco — Lt. Tawny Madison — the one who repeats the computer
WHAT  — The clear-eyed one: fully aware of how dumb her role is, and the first to name the bad writing they're trapped inside.
WHERE — GQT · Galaxy Quest (1999)  Framework inputs: Galaxy Quest (1999, dir. Dean Parisot, DreamWorks); verified cast & facts  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
